# The glass arm: light/translucent-page.trail under live glass, every light scheme (foreach-scheme
# light: the built-ins and the pack themes) drawing Prism Glass's glass ahead of LIVE, so each
# commit's trail-diff compares glass frames: a translucent page (background_opacity 0.8).

